			},
			"date": "2023-12-14T16:48:44.811Z",
			"content": "<p>Looks like Vite writes a temporary file to the file system to work around this issue 👀  <a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/blob/77d5165e2f252bfecbb0eebccc6f04dc8be0c5ba/packages/vite/src/node/config.ts#L1172-L1184\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">github.com/vitejs/vite/blob/77</span><span class=\"invisible\">d5165e2f252bfecbb0eebccc6f04dc8be0c5ba/packages/vite/src/node/config.ts#L1172-L1184</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "111580462483712264",
			"parentId": "111579792986075650",
			"url": "https://m.webtoo.ls/@patak/111580462397230587",
			"author": {
				"name": "patak",
				"url": "https://m.webtoo.ls/@patak",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/467/347/427/647/201/original/3506ee2939de8823.jpeg"
			},
			"date": "2023-12-14T19:38:59.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> We tried to remove the temporary file by using `data:` and had to revert it, but we may try again at one point. That temporary file is a terrible hack.<br><a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/13267#issuecomment-1624779173\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/</span><span class=\"invisible\">13267#issuecomment-1624779173</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "111580470444205965",
			"parentId": "111580462483712264",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/111580470444205965",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
