			},
			"date": "2023-12-14T19:41:02.002Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://m.webtoo.ls/@patak\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>patak</span></a></span> yeah—I don’t blame y’all for going down that road. It would be nice to have a stable vm.Module. It would solve a lot of ESM migration pain!</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "111580482330587997",
			"parentId": "111580470444205965",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/111580482330587997",
