			},
			"date": "2023-12-21T22:04:31.427Z",
			"content": "<p>Alert Alert: We have movement, we have movement!</p><p>A fully fledged PR to fix the issue (with a warning instead of an error): <a href=\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/51244\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">github.com/nodejs/node/pull/51</span><span class=\"invisible\">244</span></a></p><p>Exciting!</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
